<p>Shattering up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> ghouls or ghasts you create a putrescent swirling cloud of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 6</acronym> that follows you around for 3 turns per dead ghoul plus one turn. Oldest ghouls are prioritized for destruction.</p><p>Any ghoul or ghast dying or expiring within this cloud increases its duration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> turn and every two absorbed ghoul/ghast your gain back one soul.</p><p>The cloud deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">50, 67, 80, 92, 102</acronym> frostdusk damage to any foes caught inside.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p><p></p>